<title>SWEDEN: Sweden orders 64 more Saab JAS 39 Gripen.</title>
<headline>Sweden orders 64 more Saab JAS 39 Gripen.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Swedish government said on Thursday it had decided to order 64 aircraft from the third series of the JAS 39 Gripen manufactured by Sweden's Saab.</p>
</text>
